{
  "info": {
    "name": "PH Healthcare API",
    "description": "# PH Healthcare — Clinic Management API\n\nPatients book approved doctors, pay with bKash, and receive a 20-minute serial. Doctors publish schedules and write prescriptions. Admins approve doctors and manage accounts.\n\n## Auth model\nThis API uses **httpOnly cookies** (access and refresh tokens), not a Bearer header. Run **Login** once and Postman will send the cookies for later requests against the same `baseUrl`.\n\n## Roles\n- **PATIENT** — book, pay, cancel, view receipts and prescriptions\n- **DOCTOR** — schedules, visit status, prescriptions\n- **ADMIN / SUPER_ADMIN** — approve doctors, manage accounts and payments\n\n## Before you start\n1. Set `baseUrl` to `http://localhost:5000` or `https://ph-healthcare-api.vercel.app`.\n2. Run **02 - Authentication → Login**.\n3. Continue with the role you signed in as.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    },
    {
      "key": "doctorId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "scheduleId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "appointmentId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
